and we’re joined by Florida gubernatorial contender Byron Donalds.

Watch here: piped.video/live/hFwQUuCUeF0

On the show today:

As Americans wait for hours in line thanks to a defunded TSA and Americans are murdered by illegal immigrants, Democrats continue to shut down funding for the Department of Homeland Security; 

American communists travel to Cuba for fun and games;

and we bring you the latest on the war in Iran.

Watch here: piped.video/watch?v=MZo1OVpd…

On the show today:

As the war in Iran continues, Iran ups the ante by firing a long range missile capable of hitting Europe;

President Trump hints at negotiations;

and we examine the collaborationists who are rooting for the rise of China and Russia.

Watch here: piped.video/watch?v=eic5V5mX…

On the show today:

America's international allies join our cause… by writing a strongly worded letter;

the America-hating right and Left unite to undermine President Trump yet again;

and California is spending all of its money on hospice fraud and mountain lion bridges.

Watch here: piped.video/watch?v=pTtbturj…

On the show today: 

A new Netflix documentary about the so-called "manosphere" is lighting up living rooms everywhere, and we discuss what it means;

we discuss the problem of toxic femininity;

and Joe Kent’s got some serious legal troubles.

